DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260718T220000
SUMMARY:V for Volleyball Nights! July18th 4-10pm at Laurel Hill Park in Se
 caucus
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nI'm Mike 
 and my son is Mikey/Michael.\nThis locarion is artificial turf. Avoid kick
 ing\, don't use your head.\nFree to play. We'll have 2 Pro Mikasa balls & 
 1 Wilson Pro ball.\nThe courts are open to the public and if they happen t
 o be taken\, we may play with those already playing initially\, or we will
  move to the grass since we have a Volleyball NET!\nThey have a food truck
  there as well.\nIf it's looking like it'll rain\, I'll make a call on whe
 ther to cancel.\nIf you have fun and would like to play with us at other l
 ocations\, join us!\n[V for Volleyball New Jersey | Facebook](https://www.
 facebook.com/groups/1587314685975434)\n[V for Volleyball Summer Night Play
 ! July18th 6-10pm at Laurel Hill Park in Secaucus | Facebook](https://www.
 facebook.com/events/1288638486581291?acontext=%7B%22event_action_history%2
 2%3A%5B%7B%22surface%22%3A%22group%22%7D%5D%7D)\n[Volleyball Courts - Goog
 le Maps](https://www.google.com/maps/place/Volleyball+Courts/@40.7600226\,
 -74.0923928\,16.17z/data=!4m10!1m2!2m1!1svolleyball!3m6!1s0x89c257000a7a97
 8f:0x8d79b81a213d5598!8m2!3d40.7601281!4d-74.086473!15sCgp2b2xsZXliYWxsWgw
 iCnZvbGxleWJhbGySARB2b2xsZXliYWxsX2NvdXJ0mgFEQ2k5RFFVbFJRVU52WkVOb2RIbGpSa
 mx2VDIwMWJGUnNiRzFoVlU1TlVraHdkMVpYUmtOaU1rWkRWakJvTUUxSFl4QULgAQD6AQQIABA
 p!16s%2Fg%2F11yk4h9tj1?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDQyOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D
 )
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/314638376/
