SUMMARY:Asbury Park Beach Day - Volleyball\, Bring Your Own Games\, Make N
 ew friends
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nLooking f
 or things to do in Asbury Park NJ this summer… we will park by the Water
 mark area but actually want to meet people — not just be around them? Th
 is is that event.\n\nThis is a women hosted event. We just enjoy the beach
  and we would love to make new friends... We’re bringing together fun pe
 ople from across New Jersey — including New Brunswick\, Edison\, Hoboken
 \, Jersey City\, Newark\, Princeton\, Morristown\, and surrounding areas 
 — for a fun\, social beach day. We’re bringing together multiple meetu
 p groups together...a high-energy beach day of games\, movement\, and a na
 tural way to connect without forcing anything. Please bring your own chang
 e of clothes\, towels\, beach pass\, games\, snacks and drinks to share. T
 o keep this group running\, kindly donate $5. 🔥 Why This One Stands Out
  Designed to meet other people in NJ (not apps) **Beach games = easy\, nat
 ural conversations *Come solo (most do) or bring friends* Flows from beach
  → bar → night out (if people want - bring bar appropriate clothes) 
 👉 This is how people actually meet in real life 📍 Event Details (Eas
 y to Find) Location: Asbury Park Beach by Watermark 📅 Sunday\, July 19 
 2026 ⏰ Starts around 9:30am 🕒 Flow of the Day (You can come and go - 
 just check the comments) 930am → Meet at the entrance near Watermark. On
 e of us will be sitting at the bench until 10am... From the entrance\, we 
 will setup to the left side at the back of the beach... games + boardwalk.
 ..maybe until people want to stay-> Beach bar social + boardwalk 👉 Come
  anytime. Stay as long as you want. 🏐 What We’ll Be Doing We’ll aim
  to set up volleyball + rotating group games or bring kites. If you want t
 o bring any of the following games: Volleyball Spikeball Frisbee / footbal
 l Paddle ball Cornhole 👉 Movement makes it EASY to meet people 🎒 Wha
 t to Bring Beach pass (required to pay for your own) • Your own drinks /
  food *Towel\, sunscreen\, anything you need 👉 Keep it simple — come 
 ready to enjoy the day 🚗 Parking Street + paid parking available nearby
  ⚠️ Important (Quick + Clear) This is a community-driven meetup — no
 t a hosted/structured event. 👉 You’re responsible for yourself + your
  belongings 👉 No transportation coordination — please plan ahead 👉
  Be safe\, respectful\, and aware 👥 Who This Is For Singles looking for
  NJ social events or want to just meet others • People tired of apps\, b
 ars\, and low-energy meetups* Anyone who wants a fun\, social beach day 
 💥 Why You Should Come Because most people say they want to meet new peo
 ple… and never actually go. This is one of those rare chances where it
 ’s easy. 🎯 Simple Goal Meet a few new people. Enjoy the beach. See wh
 ere the night goes. ⚖️ Legal + Policies By RSVPing\, you agree: *No li
 ability for injury\, loss\, or damages Photos/videos may be used for commu
 nity promotion You may receive event updates (unsubscribe anytime) Respect
  others + public space Attend at your own discretion
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/315664831/
