DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nIt is esc
 ape room time.\n\nThe event comes to you courtesy of our WhatsApp group ch
 at.\n\nJoin us at 7:30 p.m. on July 31 at Amazing Escape Room\, 281 Libert
 y St. in Bloomfield.\n\nThis event will probably require a little planning
  and coordination. We'll provide more details and pricing as we get closer
  to event day.\n\nhttps://amazingescaperoom.com/all-rooms/\n\n\\*\\*\\* Th
 ere is a good chance we'll hang out some more at a diner or bar afterward.
  Feel free to make suggestions!! \\*\\*\\*\n\nQuestions or comments? You c
 an message Andy on Meetup\, or call/text him at 201-234-9609.\n\nThis is o
 ur first escape room trip. Feel free to also check out bowling\, soccer\, 
 volleyball\, tennis or one of our other activities at: www.meetup.com/nort
 h-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleyball.
